 ## Complexity Tracking
 
 No constitution violations. No entries required.
+
+## Task 2 addendum: Explicit routing fallback
+
+Delegate `Router::route()` to `route_with_default(model, RouteTarget::Local)`.
+Move the current rules unchanged into the new method and return the supplied
+default only at the final unrecognized-model branch. Add a typed `default_route`
+to daemon Config, read `AGENTIX_DEFAULT_ROUTE`, and pass it from the existing chat
+completion handler. Cover conflicting defaults for every rule category and all
+four targets for unknown names in router unit tests.
+
+Constitution: routing remains a pure library and the gateway keeps a Local
+fallback unless explicitly configured otherwise. The user's requested explicit
+cloud fallback is an exception to Principle II's structural escalation policy;
+existing `route()` behavior remains Local. No new dependencies or crates.
